    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# AI Agent  for Aegis Workflow\n\n#### Tools:\n- Retrieve documents from Qdrant\n#### Models (yet to experiment with better models, could definetly be upgraded)\n- **Chat Model**:  gpt5-nano\n- **Embedding Model**:  multilingual-e5-base\n- **Rethinker Model**:  qllama/bge-reranker-v2-m3",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 800
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -4848,
        -1248
      ],
      "id": "dae62494-102a-45b8-a50f-210b822e62c8",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Form Submission\n\nUpload documents to the vector database as knowledge base (duplicates rejected)\nToggle vision on if you want to uploads images from a document (LLM will create a description for them and embed it)\n",
        "height": 176,
        "width": 400
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
